Fabry disease</article-title><source>Kidney Int</source><volume>69</volume><fpage>1216</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16609685</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-btt-1-291"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cai</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Becker-Hapak</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>The kinetics and tissue distribution of protein transduction in mice</article-title><source>Eur J Pharm Sci</source><volume>27</volume><fpage>311</fpage><lpage>19</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16376528</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11-btt-1-291"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campese</surname><given-names>VM</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>HMG-CoA reductase inhibitors and the kidney</article-title><source>Kidney Int</source><volume>71</volume><fpage>1215</fpage><lpage>22</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17495867</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b12-btt-1-291"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Narrative review: Fabry disease</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><volume>146</volume><fpage>425</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17371887</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b13-btt-1-291"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>JTR</given-names></name><name><surname>West</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Bultas</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><